const good = echoer();
good.next();        // prime
good.next("hello"); // arrives`,caption:`bad's "hello" vanishes; good primes first and receives it.`},{kind:`heading`,text:`6. Prefer yield* over a manual loop`},{kind:`playground`,code:`function* inner() {
